esearch facility was in fact invaded  this means that since wakanda will not  trade vibranium with the rest of the  world some of the world is trying to  take it by force and this very very well  could be other countries trying to take  it it seems very very clear that the  other countries of the un are very  concerned with the fact that wakanda has  vibranium and will not share it and they  state that they're concerned with people  making weapons of mass destruction when  the reality is they probably just want  it for themselves but it also makes you  wonder who else wants it and most of you  probably know who i'm thinking about  right now victor von doom aka dr doom  there have been rumors going around for  a while now that dr doom will be in  wakanda forever in some way shape or  form however i would like to point out  that this is not confirmed yet we do not  know for sure if he is going to be in  the film even though he is rumored to be  appearing in a post-credits scene we  know that rumors can be wrong look at  what happened at d23 however saying that  i do think it makes a lot of sense  especially if we follow the do-more  storyline from the comics this is very  important to know and i'll explain why  in the do more storyline doom helps the  disturbee gain access to wakanda they  actually dethrone t'challa and shuri and  completely take over wakanda and they  even put the x-men storm on trial  because she is t'challa's wife in the  comics at this point in time at least  and what's interesting is we learned  that doom actually infected all of  wakandans with food and water putting  nanites in them allowing him to use  these nanites and people basically as  cameras t'challa being the black panther  has heightened senses so he realized and  caught on to what was happening and  didn't partake of any food or water and  told shuri as well so she didn't and the  both of them managed to escape however  they quickly realized that doctor doom  was only helping the distillery so he  could get into wakanda and get vibranium  and the reason why is because dr doom  has discovered a secret that nobody else  has known it can amplify mystical  energies and its effects are infinite  and for somebody like doctor doom who is  already extremely strong with mystical  energies it can basically make dr doom  unstoppable this is why i think in  wakanda forever doctor doom could be  behind one of the groups at least trying  to break into wakanda to steal some  vibranium in fact he could even be  behind namor whether that's directly or  indirectly like i said in the comics  doom helps the destiry to gain access to  wakanda's vibranium he helps them  essentially take over wakanda the same  could be happening with neymar and the  atlanteans although they won't be  atlanteans in the film they're more  likely going to be an ancient aztec or  mayan race also another scene that was  shown during this clip at d23 was riri  williams aka ironheart conducting  projects on vibranium and from what we  know the projects are her making  machines that can actually detect  vibranium in the ocean now this could  clearly upset two people here one the  wakandans and two namor obviously  wakanda does not want vibranium getting  out to the public and obviously namor  does not want people going around his  parts of the ocean discovering his  people this is most likely how riri  williams actually ends up in wakanda but  this could actually be a part of doom's  plan send people into the ocean to look  for vibranium using the technology that  riri williams created to make namor mad  and go after wakanda then once wakanda  has been flooded because we've seen that  in the first trailer and basically  wakanda taken out doctor doom can then  go in and get vibranium now again this  is just a theory and right now the rumor  has it that it's only going to be a post  credit scene where doom shows up if that  is indeed true however with the  fantastic four coming to the mcu in 2025  and avengers secret wars coming to the  mcu that same year it doesn't make sense  to not have doctor doom in the mcu as he  is one of the main villains of the  fantastic four and he is pretty much the  main villain of secret wars we get god  emperor doom in that storyline but let  me know what you think about this in the  comments down below do you think doom  could be behind atlantis vs wakanda and  of course be sure to let me know what  you think about this new footage that  was shown at d23 in the comments down  below please don't forget to like the  video and subscribe to stay up to date  on the mcu and for live updates you can  always follow me on instagram and  twitter as always thank you all so much  for watching woof  you

